From 83149fcb15fa5f27ade1b7d7c3663be1cee7a25c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Vicory <dvicory@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 02:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(workspaces): enforce durable task-run authority

Register opaque task authority, bind it atomically to broker activation, resolve specifications and tool surfaces from the durable run, constrain managed task creation, and grant scratch workspaces only their declared authority.

The former nine-patch sequence was one authority cutover expressed as successive corrections. Squashing it removes repeated edits to prompt_builder.py, worker_lanes.py, kanban_tools.py, gondolin.py, and their tests while retaining a reviewable boundary from the routing feature before it.
---
